{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1484187-demon-the-fallen-devil\u2019s-night-riots","id":1484187,"title":"Demon: The Fallen - Devil\u2019s Night riots?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-06-16T01:58:41-07:00","id":1484187,"title":"Demon: The Fallen - Devil\u2019s Night riots?","content":"To be honest, I probably missed something, but... what's the date of the Devil\u2019s Night riots?<br /> <br /> Belial used his command over the world\u2019s ley lines to summon a devastating earthquake to shake Los Angeles and flush Lucifer out; a 7.2 magnitude earthquake<br /> Now, the official records mentions only two 7.2 magnitude earthquake<br /> Jan. 22, 1923 - obviosuly, not this one, since the 6th Malestrom was in at the end of the millenium<br /> And April 25, 1992 - okay this is worse<br /> So its not &quot;happened&quot; in the real word, thats clear<br /> <br /> The cults of Manishtusu and Enshagkushanna,- two Earthbound - , attacked basically Los Angeles, and their machinations resulted in the Devil's Night riots<br /> <br /> Now, the term &quot;Devil's Night&quot; is a name associated with October 30, the night before Halloween. So it was probably Oct 30. <br /> The event was called the Devil\u2019s Night riots and lasted for five days. In the end, the servants of the Earthbound managed to corner the Morningstar, but instead of fleeing, Lucifer revealed his Apocalyptic form, in front of thousands of rioters, national guards and reporters of every major news network. The sight inspired Faith in millions all over the world, ended the riots and acted as a beacon to draw Fallen from all over the world to L.A.<br /> So Lucifer's stunt was probaly November 3. ?<br /> <br /> But, I know, this may be a silly question... in what year?<br /> <br /> The Time of Judgement was around 2002-.3? So I guess Lucifer's manifesttation tat basically heralded the End... was more or less then, I geuss<br /> But some official date would be nice, when was the Devil\u2019s Night riots?<br /> I'm sure they hid this answer somewhere in the bottom, with small letters, but, or my shame, I failed to find it so far... ^^'","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23890-shadeprowler","name":"Shadeprowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23890_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-18T19:58:22-07:00","id":1484411,"title":"","content":"As a rule of thumb Revised books tend to follow something close to the Time of Thin Blood guidelines: it doesn't have an official date, but will mostly be considered as happening little before the time of publication of the actual book.<br /> <br /> The book City of Angels was published in 2003, but its account does give some sense of time having passed, so the most probable date is 30/OCT/2002. This date also gives some time for an infernal court to form in the city and things to happen before the year of the Time of Judgement (2004).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}